<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>
</div>
<div>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal">This corporation has increased my rent consistently&=
nbsp;above the guidelines each year that they have had ownership of the pro=
perty.<o:p></o:p></p>
